OL,3,GNEWSARegulation of park homes needs
OL,4,Astrengthening, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP is calling for tougher regulation
OL,7,Fof park homes.
OL,9,FTom Hayes, Labour MP for Bournemouth
OL,10,FEast in Dorset, wants councils to have
OL,11,Fthe power to take over sites where
OL,12,Foperators have failed to comply with
OL,13,Fhealth and safety legislation.
OL,15,FHe also wants an end to the 10% sales
OL,16,Fcommission on park homes and called for
OL,17,Fa stronger fit and proper person test
OL,18,Ffor site operators.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
